Section 2 …
|

:INFO
Art. 9–10c
Repealed by Annex No 1 of the O of 14 Oct. 2015 (Optimisation New Accounting Model and New Management Model for the Federal Administration), with effect from 1 Jan. 2016 (AS 2015 4019).

